<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-METZ AND NEWCASTLE DRAW 1-1 IN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-METZ AND NEWCASTLE DRAW 1-1 IN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>METZ, France 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metz of France and Newcastle of England drew 1-1 (halftime 0-1) in their UEFA Cup third round, first leg match on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Metz - Amara Traore 67</p>
<p>Newcastle - Peter Beardsley 32 penalty</p>
<p>Attendance: 23,000.</p>
</text>
